 "description": "<p>A little devil set in patent leather: dress, collar, and thong, in black or red, one size for 40-60 kg. Patent leather moves the devil costume from chiffon-cute to midnight-serious - the material is the entire mood shift.</p>\n<p>The collar is the piece that reads devil in this construction, paired with the dress line rather than wings and horns. Black and red split the register between classic and infernal.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Material: patent leather</li>\n<li>Includes: dress, collar, thong</li>\n<li>Style: succubus / little devil</li>\n<li>Color: black or red</li>\n<li>Sizing: one size, recommended 40-60 kg</li>\n</ul>\n<p>One size for 40-60 kg. The shiny, structured option in the devil category for Halloweens that want an edge.</p>\n",
